nmap
Usage: nmap [-sT|-sV|-sC|-sn] [-p PORTS] TARGET

The deep host/service scanner: what is open, what service and version answers,
what the default scripts turn up. Slower than masscan, so scan the whole space
with masscan and go deep here on what answered.

	-sT          TCP connect scan -- works without root
	-p PORTS     limit to these ports ( -p- is all 65535 )
	-sV          probe service versions
	-sC          run the default NSE scripts
	-sn          ping sweep: who is alive, no port scan
	--script vuln   run the NSE vulnerability checks

Only against hosts you own or are authorised to test.

See also: masscan, httpx, nuclei
